    "updated": "2026-10-01",
    "body": "When self-booking is enabled for the clinic, messages to patients can include a\nprivate booking link. The patient verifies their date of birth on the page,\nthen picks a day and time from the same availability the AI offers.\n\n- Links last 7 days. Each patient has at most one active link per campaign.\n- Booking through the link marks the patient booked and cancels the pending call.\n- Too many wrong DOB attempts lock the link and send the patient for human follow-up.\n- On chat apps, patients can reply **BOOK** to receive a fresh link.\n\nSelf-booking is switched on per clinic by a platform admin. There is no toggle\nin Clinic settings yet."
