    "body": "## Steps\n\n1. Ask the platform admin to enable **chat invites** (and optionally\n   **self-booking**) for the clinic. There is no toggle in the portal yet;\n   CC can file an action item for this.\n2. Make sure patients have **sms_consent** set: invites travel in the\n   pre-call or voicemail text message.\n3. Turn on the **Pre-call text message** in Clinic settings.\n4. At the front desk, tell patients they'll get a link to receive reminders on\n   Viber (or Messenger, WhatsApp, Telegram) and should reply YES in the chat.\n5. After a campaign round, ask CC how many messages went out per channel.\n\nA printable front-desk QR code is planned but not available yet."
